  "decision_conditions": [
    "At present, this application is invalid. During the application process, you confirmed that the proposed works relate only to trees within a conservation area and not to any trees subject to a Tree Preservation Order (TPO).\r\n\r\nHowever, the tree labelled T1 is protected by a TPO. You will need to submit a new application specifically for this tree.\r\n\r\nT1 will be removed from the current application so that the remaining proposed works can be validated.\r\n\r\nMalus (T1) - To crown reduce to previous reduction points (2.0m) and remove major deadwood from mature Malus tree located in the front garden. All branches will be pruned to appropriate growth points. All works are carried out to BS 3998: 2010 Tree work recommendations. A well balanced shape will be maintained."
  ],
