  "description": "Silver Birch (T2) - To crown lift mature Silver Birch located over the footpath to 3.5m and remove the major deadwood. All branches will be pruned to appropriate growth points. All works are carried out to BS 3998: 2010 Tree work recommendations. A well balanced shape will be maintained.\t\r\n\r\nMagnolia (T3) - To  reduce mature Evergreen Magnolia located in the rear garden by 1.0m. The branches that are overhanging the neighbouring property at the rear will be reduced by 2.0m to reduce encroachment and the Ivy on the neighbouring side will be trimmed back.  All branches will be pruned to appropriate growth points. All works are carried out to BS 3998: 2010 Tree work recommendations. A well balanced shape will be maintained.",
